version 2. Most of it may also be used under any later version, but the files
that still contain upstream's code may not; see "Why upstream's code is
GPL-2.0-only" below. The licence text is in LICENSES/, once for each SPDX
identifier it is used under. LICENSE at the top level is the same verbatim
text, kept so that tools which only look there still find it.


Who holds what, under which licence
-----------------------------------

Every file states its copyright holders and licence, either in a header comment
